{"kind": "mod", "id": 2739, "name": "UnloadAllMagazines", "slug": "unloadallmagazines", "teaser": "Never again having to puzzle where the good ammunition went.", "owner_name": "maschine", "downloads": 2057, "favourites": 22, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.maschine.unloadallmagazines", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Tools", "category_id": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-08T18:02:21.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-06-12T14:01:22.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-06-12T15:23:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.0", "latest_version": "2.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Originally, this was part of my debugging tools, but I found it so useful during normal gameplay that I spun it off from it.<br />\nIt adds a simple button that unloads all magazines in stash, including those loaded in weapons.<br />\nThe ammo gets dumped in the same way as the regular unload action -&gt; same container the magazine is in, if not possible (because it’s in a magcase) the parent container.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maschine34675/UnloadAllMagazines/refs/heads/main/button.png\" alt=\"Example Picture\" /></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>As usual, unzip to your SPT folder</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Let me know if you run into any problems or have suggestions for improvement.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.4", "content_length": 6400, "downloads": 1754, "published_at": "2026-06-12T15:12:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2739/unloadallmagazines/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1.0", "content_length": 6150, "d